<title>GERMANY: German revised H1 trade surplus 42.5 bln marks.</title>
<headline>German revised H1 trade surplus 42.5 bln marks.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal</p>
<p>Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator</p>
<p>(bln marks):</p>
<p>GERMAN TRADE		   H1 96	 1995</p>
<p> Trade balance		 42.496	85.303</p>
<p> Exports			 381.773     749.465</p>
<p> Imports			 339.277     664.162</p>
<p>NOTE - The Statistics Office said it revised first half 1996 imports and exports up 2.2 percent.</p>
<p>-- William Boston, Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
